@startuml
title Sequence – Single Post Creation

participant "PostContentCreator" as PCC
participant "search_web" as SW
participant "PostContentCompliance" as PCOMP
database "ChromaDB" as DB

PCC -> SW : query best-practices
SW --> PCC : guidelines
PCC -> DB : embed + store post
PCC --> PCOMP : raw_post_text
PCOMP -> PCOMP : audit & fix
PCOMP --> PCC : compliant_post
@enduml
